# Owyx ↔ Modrinth reference

- Reference clone (read-only intent): prefer `../modrinth-code` or `reference/modrinth-code` next to / inside the workspace — remote https://github.com/modrinth/code
- Key packages: `apps/app` (Tauri), `apps/app-frontend` (UI), `packages/app-lib` (Theseus Rust launcher core).
- **Phase 1 (now):** working full Modrinth-like copy as our functional reference — port behavior and UI structure aggressively; redesign / Owyx brand / layout changes come later.
- **Phase 2:** individuality — Owyx colors, logos, private servers, own login site, possible layout redesign.
- Stack stays **Rust + Tauri 2 + Vite (HTML/CSS/TS)** unless we explicitly decide otherwise. Port patterns into Owyx; do not replace the whole product with their monorepo as the shipping app.
- When unsure about a screen or flow, open the matching Modrinth source file first.
- Player artifact: single `Owyx.exe`; data: `%USERPROFILE%/owyx`.
